WEBVTT

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.380
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.530
Dai-Tengu-sama!

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:19.740
Objection!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.870
Kitaro did nothing wrong!

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.060
Why you...!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.740
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:14.670
<i>Rin Pyou Tou Sha Kai Jin Retsu Zai Zen</i>

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:25.160
Kojiro-san, what's the meaning of this?!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.660
Kitaro-san, you're under arrest.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:36.280
CHAPTER 42

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.340
MOMON-JII'S SCHEME
THE GREAT YOKAI TRIAL

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:45.350
So, why was Kitaro arrested?

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:49.080
Yeah! What'd they say he did?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.710
Well, it seems...

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:56.610
Wait! What crime is
my son being arrested for?!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.530
GeGeGe no Kitaro,

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.120
there's a warrant for your arrest for
the obliteration of the Hitotsume-Kozo.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:07.950
There must be some mistake!
The Hitotsume-Kozo is a harmless <i>yokai</i>!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:11.080
Kitaro would never obliterate him!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.620
Save your defense for...

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.730
the Great Yokai Trial!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.630
Dad!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.010
Kitaro!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.030
Dad!

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.770
A crime of obliteration?!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.110
Did Kitaro do something to
the Hitotsume-Kozo?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.070
Of course not!

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.770
Isn't obliteration

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:40.400
a crime in name only,
that hasn't been used in centuries?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:44.490
It's from the age when
conflict between <i>yokai</i> was unending.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:47.870
Can that still apply today?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.330
The law is still the law.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:55.880
But, the Great Yokai Trial
hasn't been held in the past century.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.010
Kitaro innocent.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.340
Of course he is. Someone set him up.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.930
Are you sure?

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.720
Hear me out.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.520
How many <i>yokai</i> do you think
Kitaro's defeated until now?

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:23.360
See? Maybe this arrest is just a cover
and that's what they're really after.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.700
Rat Man!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.240
Wait, wait, wait!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.450
I'm just saying we should calm down
and settle everything in court!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.710
That's surprisingly sensible for you.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.710
What Rat Man says may be right.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:43.530
The Great Yokai Trial is sure to
reach a fair verdict.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:51.190
I'm going to check the old scriptures
and go through past trial records.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:55.520
Everyone gather <i>yokai</i> who'll give
testimony that benefits Kitaro.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.690
-Okay!
-Cotton copies!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.320
She's completely ignoring me
by not reading my texts!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.410
I was hoping to go out tomorrow.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.550
I guess Cat-san's busy?

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:12.390
...and so, Kitaro is innocent!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.000
Maybe I'm not being persuasive enough?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.650
Practicing your testimony,
Old Man Crybaby?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.320
You need to calm down.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:26.430
Who can calm down?!
Kitaro's trial is tomorrow!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.260
This is unlike you.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.260
How about a drink to get you going?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.770
That's considerate of you.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.540
Now, now, now. Drink up.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:58.830
<i>Judged and condemned
Guts spilled bare</i>

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:03.300
<i>Soaked in blood or facing death</i>

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.840
<i>With Kitaro bound by law</i>

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:11.850
<i>How will the scales of judgement tip?</i>

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:17.370
<i>Will it be cruel judgement?
Will it be heartless betrayal?</i>

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.630
Where's the rest of our defense?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.470
It doesn't make sense for Sand Witch
and the others not to come.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.910
Maybe the ones who set this up
did something.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.510
Careful with your defense.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:02.310
The Great Yokai Trial is now in session.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:07.320
In consideration of
those who can only come out at night,

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.200
the gallery will be shrouded in darkness.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.040
GeGeGe no Kitaro has been charged by
the prosecution

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.580
for the crime of the obliteration of
the Hitotsume-Kozo.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.700
Does the prosecution concur?

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.000
MOMON-JII

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.710
Dai-Tengu-sama, against the defendant,
GeGeGe no Kitaro,

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:29.340
the prosecution demands a
500-year liquefaction penalty.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.590
Dai-Tengu-sama,
the defendant pleads not guilty.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:38.220
Let the prosecution's witness,
the Yobuko, take the stand.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.380
You witnessed the scene of
the Hitotsume-Kozo's obliteration.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.030
Is that correct?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.320
Yeah.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.990
Is the individual who obliterated
the Hitotsume-Kozo in this courtroom?

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.870
I don't wanna say.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.870
You may just point if necessary.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.480
-I...
-Silence.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:12.340
Please share with us the details of
what you saw.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.060
It was a few days ago...

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:20.140
I was walking along the swamp
to go fishing.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.370
Stop! Please don't!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.810
What did I do to deserve this?!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.820
Hitotsume-Kozo?

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.940
You didn't do anything.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.320
Kitaro?

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.780
It's because you didn't do anything.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.990
<i>Yokai</i> are of no use to humans.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.890
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.870
A <i>yokai</i> who obliterates <i>yokai</i> for humans.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.000
Hair Needles!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.390
Hitotsume-Kozo was...!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:10.650
Kitaro said he was a
"<i>yokai</i> who obliterates <i>yokai</i> for humans."

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.760
Are you sure of that?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:19.750
You also witnessed the obliteration of the
Hitotsume-Kozo by hair needles?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:20.830
Yeah.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.460
The prosecution submits
evidence number one,

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.660
hair needles from the scene.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.170
Number three and seven,

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.670
Kitaro's geta and a geta footprint
left at the scene.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.390
The court acknowledges that they are
a perfect match.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.660
No further questions.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.570
Yobuko-san, do you go fishing often?

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.440
Every now and then.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.820
Do you often encounter friends then?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.530
Hardly ever.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.660
That's strange.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.290
So, at a place
you rarely encounter friends,

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:07.460
you just happened to stumble upon
the Hitotsume-Kozo being obliterated?

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.830
Objection!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.090
This questioning is irrelevant!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.840
No, it has very important relevance!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.590
Objection overruled.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.010
Continue.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:17.970
Well?

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.220
Now that you mention it, you're right!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.230
In a location
you rarely encounter friends,

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:28.370
you coincidentally stumbled upon
the Hitotsume-Kozo being obliterated.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.730
Don't you think it's strange?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:34.230
You happened to,
coincidentally, just by chance...

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.660
Try to remember clearly.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:42.370
Did you really see the moment when
the Hitotsume-Kozo was obliterated?

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:46.250
Was it really the defendant who did it?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:52.460
Isn't it possible you were set up
just so you could be a witness?!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.250
Objection!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.050
The defense is intentionally
leading the witness

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.010
by repeatedly saying "coincidence!"

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:04.890
The fact that it may have been a setup
is unsubstantiated speculation!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.890
Objection sustained.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:10.670
Strike the defense's words
from the record.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.270
No further questions.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.030
What a shame!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.400
Shouldn't she pace herself more?

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.280
Kitaro good guy.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.280
Kitaro innocent.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.120
Talk about unconvincing...

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:31.670
Well, don't worry about it.
This is what best friends are for.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.170
We're counting on you, Rat Man!

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.590
What is your relation to the defendant?

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.850
We've been
best, best, best friends forever!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.390
Refrain from unnecessary embellishment.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.800
Yessir.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.020
As his best friend,

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:53.170
do you believe the defendant would ever
obliterate the Hitotsume-Kozo?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:59.800
As his best friend,
it truly pains me to say this, but...

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.660
it's absolutely possible!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.530
Wh...?!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.280
What are you talking about?!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.790
Continue.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:11.750
The defendant always acts as
a friend of the humans

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.290
and regularly obliterates us <i>yokai</i>!

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.440
-Rat Man...
-Silence.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:24.800
The Nobiagari, the Tantanbo,
and numerous others have been obliterated.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.680
All to help the humans!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.680
Our kin!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.730
That many?!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.940
He's an ally of the humans?!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.730
You've been helped by Kitaro, haven't you?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.320
Kitaro is a friend!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.490
The defendant is
a traitor to the <i>yokai</i> world.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.510
Why you...!

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.720
Order!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:51.790
This court will not allow such behavior!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:55.000
Control yourself
or you will be thrown out!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.710
Forgive me.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.170
No further questions.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.290
The prosecution?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.090
The prosecution has no questions.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:06.680
However, I would like to call upon
one more witness.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:12.060
There was no prior notification of
such a request.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.020
It's a very important witness.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.770
Then let the prosecution's witness
take the stand.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.660
Mana-san...?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.440
Why...?!

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:39.670
HITOTSUME-KOZO

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.170
KONOHA-TENGU

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.070
-<i>"Eek!"</i>
-<i>"What?"</i>

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.070
<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:45.570
Why?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.090
A human?!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:53.220
Dai-Tengu-sama, a human cannot be
a witness in the Great Yokai Trial!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:58.520
Mana Inuyama is the only human
granted free passage to the GeGeGe Forest.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:01.860
I believe she is
qualified to be a witness.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:07.240
If she can enter the GeGeGe Forest,
we will accept her as a witness.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.990
What is your relation to the defendant?

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.500
We're friends.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.870
Have you ever witnessed the defendant
obliterate a <i>yokai</i>?

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:21.750
What's "obliterate"?

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:25.760
To destroy one's physical form
from this world.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.740
You've witnessed such a thing,
haven't you?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.680
Kitaro did nothing wrong!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.430
Answer with a "yes" or a "no".

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.250
Yes.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.440
Did you hear that?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:50.410
The defendant was so bold as to obliterate
one of our own in front of a human.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.120
Kitaro was only trying to protect humans!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:57.290
He obliterated <i>yokai</i> to protect humans.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.120
Is that right?

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:02.800
He really obliterated <i>yokai</i>!

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.880
Kitaro is an ally of the humans!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.050
But there are good humans too.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.340
A <i>yokai</i> obliterated <i>yokai</i>!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.850
But there are bad <i>yokai</i> too!

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.680
You like humans, don't you?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.730
What?!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.700
You're a disgrace to <i>yokai</i>!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.770
Traitor! Traitor!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.380
Have you ever seen these before?

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.280
Do you know to whom they belong?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.760
Answer the question please!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:33.160
I believe they're Kitaro's.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.010
Speak up.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.620
I believe they're Kitaro's!

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.330
The prosecution rests.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.480
The defense may examine.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:49.070
The defense has no questions.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.470
Catchick...

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.930
Why, Cat-san?!
Kitaro's ruling is on the line here!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:03.190
Both sides have completed their arguments.
We shall now deliberate.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.470
Kitaro has to be innocent!

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.320
We have reached our verdict.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:19.040
With numerous pieces of evidence and
testimony, Kitaro is definitively guilty!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.410
He is sentenced to
500 years liquefaction!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.790
But...!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.790
Take Kitaro to
the execution site immediately.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.130
Carry out
the liquefaction sentence right--

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.740
Please wait!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.720
I will not dispute the verdict.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:40.440
However, though he is a <i>yokai</i>,
500 years may as well be a last farewell.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:45.060
Please! Please allow me to
speak of my son and I!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.880
Very well.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.470
It was a dark and stormy night...

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.330
Cat-san, at this rate Kitaro will be--

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.580
This trial is a farce!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:02.580
We have to find the real culprit
or we can't prove Kitaro's innocence!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.080
But there's no time!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.050
Huh? Haven't you heard it before, Mana?

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.750
Daddy Eyeball-san bragging
about his son.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.260
Together with Mizuki,

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:14.090
-we borrowed a room over the store.
-Who's got time for this crap?

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:16.640
Old Man Crybaby-san, wake up!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.100
Mana.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:21.020
This is how you do it!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.460
Mana-chan?

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:28.940
There's no time!
I need to get to the trial!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.200
It's already over!
They found Kitaro guilty!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.320
What?!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.530
Why were you asleep?!

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:39.330
Rat Man offered me
a drink to get me going.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.540
I knew it was him!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.410
Sand Witch-san!

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.960
A Bake-Garasu!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:51.460
Gemme outta here already!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.840
Are these hair needles?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.840
That Momon-Jii got me with his
Nose Hair Bind!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.220
Nose Hair Bind?!

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:03.100
Could it be that the hair needles that
obliterated the Hitotsume-Kozo were...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.100
Momon-Jii's... nose hairs?

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.980
Money trumps friendship every time.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.820
Friends betray, but money never does.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:17.410
What a lot of money.
I wonder how much there is.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.550
At least a hundred million.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.660
You sewer rat!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.790
You were dazzled by money
and betrayed Kitaro?!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.920
Betrayed is a bit much. What's 500 years?

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.880
For a <i>yokai</i>, that amount of time isn't--

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.360
It's different!

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.680
500 years for a <i>yokai</i>...

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.550
and 500 years for a human...

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.550
is different.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:46.060
Fine already.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.440
Just then a huge wall of water came and--

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:52.310
You've spoken for quite enough.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:56.420
We shall now commence with the sentence.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.680
Bring the liquefying solution here!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.660
Dai-Tengu-sama!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:10.870
Remove his clothes
and put him in the liquefying solution.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.460
Kitaro-san...

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.430
Hold it right there!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:20.470
Dai-Tengu-sama,
this whole thing is a setup!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.720
A human brat has no right to speak!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.520
Say it in front of everyone!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:27.730
I get it! I get it!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.480
My testimony was a lie.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.600
A lie?

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.730
Don't forget that the geta print matched!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.070
I actually stole that geta,

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:41.120
handed it to Momon-Jii,
and returned it to Kitaro later.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.700
He said he'd pay me quite handsomely.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:47.460
Will you believe the word of a half-<i>yokai</i>
who admits to lying?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.540
You're the keeper of the law,
Dai-Tengu-sama!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:54.000
Here's a nose hair that Momon-Jii
used to tie me down.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:57.920
It's the same as the weapon used to
obliterate the Hitotsume-Kozo!

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.760
Momon-Jii!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.010
Why did you do this?!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:11.640
I was told if I entrap Kitaro, I would
be made the top of the <i>yokai</i> world!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.320
He was the one
who let me take Kitaro's form!

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:17.900
Who was it?! Say his name!

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.360
He said he had no name!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.070
Kitaro is innocent!

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:31.330
Momon-Jii is guilty of obliterating
the Hitotsume-Kozo and other high crimes

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.230
and is sentenced to liquefaction!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:39.070
You can spend the next 700 years
as a liquid to regret your sins!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:43.350
Rat Man! For falsifying evidence,
you are sentenced to 100 spankings!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:46.660
I-I-I was put up to this by Momon-Jii!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.520
Suffer yourself to be bound!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:53.020
No! I don't wanna be spanked 100 times!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:54.440
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:57.400
You're always the one saving me, Kitaro.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.900
Well, both Mana and I worked hard,

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:03.910
so maybe an <i>anmitsu</i> dessert set from
the tea shop will do?

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.890
Okay. I'll think about it.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:08.870
Kitaro?

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:12.420
I'm tired so I'm going home for a nap.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:15.350
Mana, well done!

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:18.500
<i>Could it be Nanashi?</i>

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:22.010
-What a day.
-<i>Sweet and hot!</i>

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.010
<i>Deli--</i>

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:33.830
<i>Nameless, none, none
No friends</i>

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.520
<i>Neither </i>yokai

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.780
-<i>Nor human</i>
-Are you an ally of the humans?!

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:41.740
-<i>Neither living being</i>
-How dare you!

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.950
-<i>Nor deceased</i>
-We won't forgive humans!

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:49.280
-<i>Merely filling an empty vessel</i>
-He's no <i>yokai</i>!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.960
<i>...cious, delicious
roasted sweet potatoes!</i>

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.770
<i>Roasted sweet potatoes!</i>

