<i>abake zenbu itsuwari dassa</i>

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:13.910
<i>If you're gonna show your teeth
Bite until they're dead</i>

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:13.910
<i>kiba mukennara shinu made kameyo</i>

